Carnivorous ink is a black, glossy thing that lies in the dark inside the [[Phenomena/Gloaming Codex|Gloaming Codex]]. It waits flat and still like a spill of ink until something comes near, then reaches out in tendrils to wrap around it and crush. An axe passed straight through one without leaving a mark. Magic cut one in half, and where it parted it made two pools that moved apart on their own.
